Portions ported (2025):
  src/core/schedule.ts        → src/taskboard/schedule.js
  src/core/tasks.ts           → src/taskboard/domain.js
  src/core/use-cases/*        → src/taskboard/domain.js
  src/core/store.ts           → src/taskboard/parse.js
  shared/host/dsh-home.ts     → src/taskboard/dsh-home.js
  src/host-ledger.ts          → src/taskboard/ledger.js
  src/host-runner.ts          → src/taskboard/runner.js
  src/host-service.ts         → src/taskboard/service.js
  src/protocol.ts             → src/taskboard/protocol.js
  src/host-routes.ts (shape)  → src/taskboard/routes.js
  src/client/board/*          → src/client/taskboard/{panel,detail,new-task}.js
  src/client/board/TaskCard timestamp helpers → src/client/taskboard/format.js

Modifications from the original: TypeScript converted to plain JavaScript;
browser v1 import action, cross-browser merge, idle-sleep (power) inhibitor,
trusted reverse-proxy token access, SSE event stream, system-prompt
announcement section, and settings card removed; HTTP routes moved to the
/workbench/taskboard/* namespace; ledger directory moved to
$DSH_HOME/dsh-work; client UI adapted to dsh-work's tab system (no sidebar
injection, no center-column takeover; polling instead of SSE); copy
simplified to Chinese.

